{"id":"4ff4df70f0b21aee","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-log-depth.md","title":"对数 CRAM 时间与对数归纳深度","display":"thm-log-depth — 对数 CRAM 时间与对数归纳深度","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-log-depth","aliases":["29-thm-log-depth"],"display":"thm-log-depth — 对数 CRAM 时间与对数归纳深度","depends_on":["[[29-df-iterated-quantifier-block]]","[[29-thm-cram-ind-fo]]","[[29-df-cram]]","[[29-df-ind]]","[[29-df-string-structures]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 5.2, p.71, DjVu scan 86; logarithmic-time specialization","source_basis":"原书文本层；从本库标准串输入三项刻画作对数函数特化","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-log-depth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-log-depth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-log-depth — 对数 CRAM 时间与对数归纳深度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7174257cf5cba5d4\" href=\"?note=7174257cf5cba5d4\" title=\"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block\">29-df-iterated-quantifier-block</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1e73231d304a46ec\" href=\"?note=1e73231d304a46ec\" title=\"29-thm-cram-ind-fo\">29-thm-cram-ind-fo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0ec85e1fbf0907b1\" href=\"?note=0ec85e1fbf0907b1\" title=\"29-df-cram\">29-df-cram</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bc0d9cb665f96790\" href=\"?note=bc0d9cb665f96790\" title=\"29-df-ind\">29-df-ind</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e8abb8daacc5641b\" href=\"?note=e8abb8daacc5641b\" title=\"29-df-string-structures\">29-df-string-structures</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 5.2, p.71, DjVu scan 86; logarithmic-time specialization"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书文本层；从本库标准串输入三项刻画作对数函数特化"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(n)=\\lceil\\log_2(n+1)\\rceil\">\\(\\ell(n)=\\lceil\\log_2(n+1)\\rceil\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span>；并行可构造性取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0ec85e1fbf0907b1\" href=\"?note=0ec85e1fbf0907b1\" title=\"29-df-cram\">29-df-cram</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PTC}\">\\(\\operatorname{PTC}\\)</span>，在 Assertion 中列明。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CRAM}[T,p,w]\">\\(\\mathrm{CRAM}[T,p,w]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0ec85e1fbf0907b1\" href=\"?note=0ec85e1fbf0907b1\" title=\"29-df-cram\">29-df-cram</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IND}[t,\\sigma;\\mathcal D]\">\\(\\mathrm{IND}[t,\\sigma;\\mathcal D]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"bc0d9cb665f96790\" href=\"?note=bc0d9cb665f96790\" title=\"29-df-ind\">29-df-ind</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\tau_{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT},S}\">\\(\\tau=\\tau_{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT},S}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A_w^\\tau\">\\(\\mathfrak A_w^\\tau\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e8abb8daacc5641b\" href=\"?note=e8abb8daacc5641b\" title=\"29-df-string-structures\">29-df-string-structures</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_w=(\\mathfrak A_w^\\tau,&lt;_{|w|})\">\\(U_w=(\\mathfrak A_w^\\tau,&lt;_{|w|})\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^\\uparrow\">\\(\\tau^\\uparrow\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau\">\\(E_\\tau\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_\\tau\">\\(\\mathcal O_\\tau\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"7174257cf5cba5d4\" href=\"?note=7174257cf5cba5d4\" title=\"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block\">29-df-iterated-quantifier-block</a> 的标准数值扩张接口。</li>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"1e73231d304a46ec\" href=\"?note=1e73231d304a46ec\" title=\"29-thm-cram-ind-fo\">29-thm-cram-ind-fo</a> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=\\ell\">\\(t=\\ell\\)</span> 的对应；IND 的资源界只在下式的标准词扩张输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span> 上要求。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A_w^\\uparrow\\coloneqq E_\\tau(U_w),\\qquad\\mathcal D\\coloneqq\\{\\mathfrak A_w^\\uparrow\\mid w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{+}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A_w^\\uparrow\\coloneqq E_\\tau(U_w),\\qquad\\mathcal D\\coloneqq\\{\\mathfrak A_w^\\uparrow\\mid w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{+}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup_{a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}}\\mathrm{CRAM}[a\\,\\ell,n\\mapsto n^b,b\\,\\ell]=\\left\\{\\{w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{+}\\mid\\mathfrak A_w^\\uparrow\\in Q\\}\\ \\middle|\\ Q\\in\\bigcup_{c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}}\\mathrm{IND}[c\\,\\ell,\\tau^\\uparrow;\\mathcal D]\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigcup_{a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}}\\mathrm{CRAM}[a\\,\\ell,n\\mapsto n^b,b\\,\\ell]=\\left\\{\\{w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{+}\\mid\\mathfrak A_w^\\uparrow\\in Q\\}\\ \\middle|\\ Q\\in\\bigcup_{c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}}\\mathrm{IND}[c\\,\\ell,\\tau^\\uparrow;\\mathcal D]\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PTC}(\\ell).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PTC}(\\ell).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 5.2，印刷71页、扫描86。此条为既有三项刻画的对数时间特化；计时控制可以逐位扫描输入长度寄存器，在 O(log n) 轮内形成足够的运行控制。此前直接调用未限制到标准 BIT 输入的 IND[t,tau]，又省略端点等数值扩张，不能由上游定理直接推出。本轮统一采用标准词扩张及同一资源论域；不在任意伪 BIT 结构上追加未经证明的对数深度界。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block","status":"resolved","id":"7174257cf5cba5d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-iterated-quantifier-block]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-cram-ind-fo","status":"resolved","id":"1e73231d304a46ec","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-cram-ind-fo]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-cram","status":"resolved","id":"0ec85e1fbf0907b1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-cram]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ind","status":"resolved","id":"bc0d9cb665f96790","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ind]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-string-structures","status":"resolved","id":"e8abb8daacc5641b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-string-structures]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-cram","status":"resolved","id":"0ec85e1fbf0907b1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\ell(n)=\\lceil\\log_2(n+1)\\rceil$，$n\\geq1$；并行可构造性取 [[29-df-cram]] 的 $\\operatorname{PTC}$，在 Assertion 中列明。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-cram","status":"resolved","id":"0ec85e1fbf0907b1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CRAM}[T,p,w]$ 见 [[29-df-cram]]；$\\mathrm{IND}[t,\\sigma;\\mathcal D]$ 见 [[29-df-ind]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ind","status":"resolved","id":"bc0d9cb665f96790","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CRAM}[T,p,w]$ 见 [[29-df-cram]]；$\\mathrm{IND}[t,\\sigma;\\mathcal D]$ 见 [[29-df-ind]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-string-structures","status":"resolved","id":"e8abb8daacc5641b","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau=\\tau_{<,\\mathrm{BIT},S}$，$\\mathfrak A_w^\\tau$ 见 [[29-df-string-structures]]；$U_w=(\\mathfrak A_w^\\tau,<_{|w|})$。$\\tau^\\uparrow$、$E_\\tau$ 和 $\\mathcal O_\\tau$ 取 [[29-df-iterated-quantifier-block]] 的标准数值扩张接口。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block","status":"resolved","id":"7174257cf5cba5d4","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau=\\tau_{<,\\mathrm{BIT},S}$，$\\mathfrak A_w^\\tau$ 见 [[29-df-string-structures]]；$U_w=(\\mathfrak A_w^\\tau,<_{|w|})$。$\\tau^\\uparrow$、$E_\\tau$ 和 $\\mathcal O_\\tau$ 取 [[29-df-iterated-quantifier-block]] 的标准数值扩张接口。","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-cram-ind-fo","status":"resolved","id":"1e73231d304a46ec","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[29-thm-cram-ind-fo]] 对 $t=\\ell$ 的对应；IND 的资源界只在下式的标准词扩张输入 $\\mathcal D$ 上要求。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\ell(n)=\\lceil\\log_2(n+1)\\rceil","display":false},{"tex":"n\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PTC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CRAM}[T,p,w]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IND}[t,\\sigma;\\mathcal D]","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau=\\tau_{<,\\mathrm{BIT},S}","display":false},{"te